= Tài liệu tham khảo <nonumber>

Các số mũ trong nội dung chương trỏ đến danh mục dưới đây. RFC 2475 và tài liệu QoS IP được cung cấp là các nguồn trực tiếp cho phần traffic conditioning, policing/shaping và bucket. Các RFC về DiffServ PHB, IntServ/RSVP và sách Kurose-Ross được liệt kê để đối chiếu bối cảnh QoS/IP theo tài liệu môn học.

*[1]* Blake, S., Black, D., Carlson, M., Davies, E., Wang, Z., Weiss, W., _An Architecture for Differentiated Services_, RFC 2475, IETF, December 1998. [RFC Editor](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2475)

*[2]* Kurose, J. F., Ross, K. W., _Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach_, Chapter 4, Pearson. (Đối chiếu ấn bản được sử dụng trong học phần.)

*[3]* Nichols, K., Blake, S., Baker, F., Black, D., _Definition of the Differentiated Services Field (DS Field) in the IPv4 and IPv6 Headers_, RFC 2474, IETF, December 1998. [RFC Editor](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2474)

*[4]* Heinanen, J., Baker, F., Weiss, W., Wroclawski, J., _Assured Forwarding PHB Group_, RFC 2597, IETF, June 1999. [RFC Editor](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2597)

*[5]* Davie, B., Charny, A., Bennet, J. C. R., Benson, K., Le Boudec, J. Y., Courtney, W., Davari, S., Firoiu, V., Stiliadis, D., _An Expedited Forwarding PHB (Per-Hop Behavior)_, RFC 3246, IETF, March 2002. [RFC Editor](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3246)

*[6]* Braden, R., Clark, D., Shenker, S., _Integrated Services in the Internet Architecture: an Overview_, RFC 1633, IETF, June 1994. [RFC Editor](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc1633)

*[7]* Braden, R., Zhang, L., Berson, S., Herzog, S., Jamin, S., _Resource ReSerVation Protocol (RSVP) -- Version 1 Functional Specification_, RFC 2205, IETF, September 1997. [RFC Editor](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2205)

*[8]* Hoàng Trọng Minh, _Chất lượng dịch vụ IP_, tài liệu được giảng viên cung cấp (`pages_from_qosip_2_8907.pdf`).

*[9]* Schulzrinne, H., Casner, S., Frederick, R., Jacobson, V., _RTP: A Transport Protocol for Real-Time Applications_, RFC 3550, IETF, July 2003. [RFC Editor](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3550)

*[10]* Bless, R., Nichols, K., Wehrle, K., _A Lower Effort Per-Domain Behavior (PDB) for Differentiated Services_, RFC 3662, IETF, December 2003. [RFC Editor](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3662)

*[11]* Babiarz, J., Chan, K., Baker, F., _Configuration Guidelines for DiffServ Service Classes_, RFC 4594, IETF, August 2006. [RFC Editor](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4594)

*[12]* Iyengar, J., Thomson, M., _QUIC: A UDP-Based Multiplexed and Secure Transport_, RFC 9000, IETF, May 2021. [RFC Editor](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9000)

*[13]* Bishop, M., _HTTP/3_, RFC 9114, IETF, June 2022. [RFC Editor](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9114)

*[14]* International Telecommunication Union, _One-way transmission time_, ITU-T Recommendation G.114. [ITU](https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.114)

*[15]* Zoom, _Using DSCP Marking with Zoom_. [Zoom Technical Library](https://library.zoom.com/admin-corner/network-management/quality-of-service-and-network-best-practices-explainer/using-dscp-marking-with-zoom)

*[16]* Zoom, _Firewall requirements_. [Zoom Support](https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&sysparm_article=KB0065712)

*[17]* Zoom, _How Zoom Audio and Video Codecs Affect Bandwidth Usage_. [Zoom Technical Library](https://library.zoom.com/admin-corner/network-management/quality-of-service-and-network-best-practices-explainer/how-zoom-audio-and-video-codecs-affect-bandwidth-usage)

